      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `3c3cbc1753cf0cdd4b77364beaa8e8ec55ab4607d91cdbe724f13159ac8471a2--KempseyLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | 68a5e7e3beddbf0b50671e83e9e1a99a1c2e554b5fdc629d7ad6cf326cd6c9f1 | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | 64d48730992eb6ea9c641dd515985d0f8955cf7b152456e7a90ea26ad9729427 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | f0b2e7f6323c91b3fa9a5fc4ee78c7d1db452b4e8ccd0168cd1202f7a39572ed | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | 8cb60b07afc08e78411a63fe844045580bae9159bd78bf8433fdea598a849f63 | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | 946275a5ddecc07bdcddeb7cfe445860fb9208242704452c2add94e765434dd4 | missing |\n| \"Month\" | 78c046ecc04bec677e020c448fac1860e93e9c069f207e5f0723fe04dd4718ec | missing |\n| \"Time\" | 9edd682e331605b31a65de2cd396cb8de92023b09b9b78baa13adfe60c8ad1b5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
